{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"它把先前的安稳真实发生过却不能保证继续留存，解释为熟悉声音虽能重新牵动他、却不足以恢复把握的原因，并进一步说明身体为何先于念头认出失重、反复加力无效为何使他转向收住自己，以及“靠撑着维持珍惜”的应对为何最终变成消耗；但尊严、秩序、克制等具体策略及部分先前经历属于较强的心理补写，不能仅凭这段听感记录得到充分证实。\",\n    \"乙\": \"它借助先前挺立、敞开而未获回应、喘息中预感别离以及反复聚力失败等经历，交代回返为何仍能触动他却不能使他安顿、长期耗力为何使珍惜只能断续浮现；但它没有明确说明身体失重先于意识判断的反应顺序，也没有充分展开应对方式如何改变当下感受的具体机制。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"甲 版不差于 乙 版\",\n  \"why\": \"甲更清楚地串起了“回返未能保证留存—身体先感到失重—反复用力无效而转为耗竭—最终只能碎片式回想”的因果链，尽管部分心理背景补写得较具体，但在解释当下转折、身体反应及应对方式的反馈机制上并不逊于乙，且更为明确。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ab492d67-a65d-40f2-b4a9-9868cfb86569", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134316340305Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.437, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:43:53.777823+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d877bc53fd010a5cac1a7831ce3ff3caee2c7b3c4564e4c5b09a14412a2f7093", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc